---
title: "RAVG | Texas Aerial Robotics"
description: "RAVG is the Texas Aerial Robotics team competing in the RTX Autonomous Vehicle Competition, pairing a scout UAV with a delivery vehicle."
ogDescription: "Our team in the RTX Autonomous Vehicle Competition."
navKey: "ravg"
---

  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="eyebrow">TAR at RTX</span>
      <h1 class="page-hero__title">RAVG</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        Our team in the RTX Autonomous Vehicle Competition. We are proud to
        have a team participating in this prestigious competition, which
        presents a unique challenge where both aerial and ground robots are
        employed in dynamic and strategic environments.
      </p>
      <div class="btn-row">
        <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/contact.html">Join the team</a>
        <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/partners.html">Sponsor RAVG</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===============================================================
       THIS YEAR'S TASK

       RTX sets a new task every year. Everything on this page that
       changes with it — the headline, the paragraph, the mission
       sequence, and the vehicles below — is written in
       src/content/ravg-competition.txt. Edit that file each season.
       =============================================================== -->
  <section class="section section--light">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="split">
        <div class="reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">This year's task</span>
          <hr class="rule" />
          <h2>{{ ravg.task.headline }}</h2>
          <p class="lede">{{ ravg.task.overview }}</p>
        </div>

        <div class="panel reveal">
          <p class="panel__title">Mission sequence</p>
          <ul class="list-check">
            {%- for step in ravg.steps %}
            <li><strong>{{ step.step }}.</strong> {{ step.detail }}</li>
            {%- endfor %}
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===============================================================
       THE TWO VEHICLES
       =============================================================== -->
  <section class="section section--dark section--grid">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section__header">
        <span class="eyebrow">The system</span>
        <hr class="rule" />
        <h2>Two vehicles, one mission.</h2>
        <p class="lede">
          RAVG splits into vehicle teams that have to agree on a shared
          picture of the world before either one moves.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid--2">
        {%- for vehicle in ravg.vehicles %}
        <article class="card reveal">
          <span class="card__icon">
            <span
              class="icon icon--{{ vehicle.icon }} icon--lg"
              aria-hidden="true"
            ></span>
          </span>
          <p class="card__index">Vehicle {% if loop.index < 10 %}0{% endif %}{{ loop.index }}</p>
          <h3 class="card__title">{{ vehicle.vehicle }}</h3>
          <p class="card__body">{{ vehicle.description }}</p>
          <div class="card__spacer"></div>
          <ul class="tags">
            {%- for tag in vehicle.tags %}
            <li class="tag">{{ tag }}</li>
            {%- endfor %}
          </ul>
        </article>
        {%- endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===============================================================
       WHAT YOU WORK ON
       =============================================================== -->
  <section class="section section--muted">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section__header">
        <span class="eyebrow">On the team</span>
        <hr class="rule" />
        <h2>What RAVG members work on.</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid--3">
        <article class="card reveal">
          <span class="card__icon">
            <span class="icon icon--code icon--lg" aria-hidden="true"
            ></span>
          </span>
          <p class="card__index">Software</p>
          <h3 class="card__title">Autonomy stack</h3>
          <p class="card__body">
            Flight control, path planning, and the vision pipeline that
            turns camera frames into a landing zone the vehicles can agree
            on.
          </p>
          <div class="card__spacer"></div>
          <ul class="tags">
            <li class="tag">ROS</li>
            <li class="tag">PX4</li>
            <li class="tag">C++</li>
            <li class="tag">Python</li>
          </ul>
        </article>

        <article class="card reveal">
          <span class="card__icon">
            <span class="icon icon--wrench icon--lg" aria-hidden="true"
            ></span>
          </span>
          <p class="card__index">Hardware</p>
          <h3 class="card__title">Airframe and payload</h3>
          <p class="card__body">
            Frame design, avionics layout, power budgeting, and the release
            mechanism that has to put the package down exactly where it
            belongs.
          </p>
          <div class="card__spacer"></div>
          <ul class="tags">
            <li class="tag">CAD</li>
            <li class="tag">Manufacturing</li>
            <li class="tag">PCB design</li>
            <li class="tag">Avionics</li>
          </ul>
        </article>

        <article class="card reveal">
          <span class="card__icon">
            <span class="icon icon--cpu icon--lg" aria-hidden="true"
            ></span>
          </span>
          <p class="card__index">Integration</p>
          <h3 class="card__title">Test and fly</h3>
          <p class="card__body">
            Simulation before flight, then range days: calibrating,
            repeating runs, and hunting down the failure modes that only
            appear outdoors.
          </p>
          <div class="card__spacer"></div>
          <ul class="tags">
            <li class="tag">Gazebo</li>
            <li class="tag">Flight testing</li>
            <li class="tag">Safety procedures</li>
            <li class="tag">Systems engineering</li>
          </ul>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-band">
    <div class="container container--narrow">
      <h2>Competition season runs all year.</h2>
      <p>
        RAVG recruits at the start of each semester, and sponsors help cover
        airframes, sensors, and travel to the competition.
      </p>
      <div class="btn-row">
        <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/contact.html">Get in touch</a>
        <a class="btn btn--outline" href="/donate.html">Support the team</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
